\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces TSR mean and min--max range over 5 independent task seeds (split sizes are 400, 600, 600, and 200, respectively). Chain-Aware shows the largest productivity variance (0.293--0.452), so single-seed comparisons should use its 5-seed mean.}}{5}{table.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:seed_variance}{{11}{5}{TSR mean and min--max range over 5 independent task seeds (split sizes are 400, 600, 600, and 200, respectively). Chain-Aware shows the largest productivity variance (0.293--0.452), so single-seed comparisons should use its 5-seed mean}{table.11}{}}
